		{
			"id": "R10-formal-reflection-fidelity",
			"statement": "Check actual finite coordinate reversal, linear maps, complementary orthogonal projectors, affine reflection and perturbation against the contract and blind readback. Inspect true nontrivial cases and premises; do not claim physical feasibility or optimizer confinement.",
